      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ORANGE CRUSH (1) took advantage of the inside draw and gave a big sight in front when second and beaten 1.1 lengths (25.93) at this track in a Maiden over 450m. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Top chance in this line up. MACCHIATO (8) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at Horsham over 410m behind Paw Drummond (23.95) in a Maiden. Placed at her previous run. Worth another chance. SCOTT SALISH (2) is yet to break through in 11 starts but has run a number of placings. Was sixth (31.26) at The Meadows latest and although yet to win tends to go well here. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. EXCLAMATION (6) was a debut placegetter out of the same box. Has upside and worth considering.",
